<title>FRANCE: Details of ONIC 1997 grain crop estimates.</title>
<headline>Details of ONIC 1997 grain crop estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC issued the following estimates for 1997 grain production, yields and sowings (figures are in tonnes for output and yield per hectare, and in hectares for sowings. Year-on-year change in percent).</p>
<p>			 Area	  Yield	   Output</p>
<p>SOFT WHEAT</p>
<p>1997/98	   4,912,650     6.922	   34,005,005</p>
<p>1996/97	   4,754,260     7.296	   34,685,284</p>
<p>Change		  +3.33     -5.12		  -1.96</p>
<p>DURUM WHEAT</p>
<p>1997/98	     258,390     3.612		933,289</p>
<p>1996/97	     269,775     4.652	    1,254,985</p>
<p>Change		  -4.22    -22.36		 -25.63</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>1997/98	   1,619,750     5.830	    9,443,580</p>
<p>1996/97	   1,526,585     6.249	    9,540,346</p>
<p>Change		  +6.10     -6.71		  -1.01</p>
<p>OATS</p>
<p>1997/98	     127,350     4.066		517,840</p>
<p>1996/97	     139,890     4.448		622,225</p>
<p>Change		  -8.96     -8.58		 -16.78</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>1997/98		43,770     4.581		200,520</p>
<p>1996/97		48,920     4.603		225,167</p>
<p>Change		 -10.53     -0.47		 -10.95</p>
<p>TRITICALE 1997/98		200,880    4.841		972,430</p>
<p>1996/97		198,350    5.272	    1,045,741</p>
<p>Change		   +1.28    -8.18		  -7.01</p>
<p>TOTAL</p>
<p>1997/98	    7,162,790    6.432	   46,072,664</p>
<p>1996/97	    6,937,780    6.828	   47,373,748</p>
<p>Change		   +3.24    -5.80		  -2.75</p>
</text>
